    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RPG Forever - Seren's Quest</i>, you awaken in a world stripped of every memory. You are Seren\u2014a wanderer with no past, thrown into the mysterious land of Expressiaann, where fate whispers of a destiny tied to forces beyond your understanding. As you journey across haunting ruins and mystical landscapes, you\u2019ll meet characters whose stories intertwine with your own, each holding pieces of a forgotten puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Narrative: Experience a richly woven story where every choice shapes Seren\u2019s path\u2014and the fate of Maiko itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living World: Explore a dynamic and immersive world filled with secrets, mysteries, and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Quests and Puzzles: Take on quests that challenge your mind, and solve puzzles that unlock hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful Choices: Shape Seren\u2019s identity and relationships through decisions that ripple across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Visuals: Immerse yourself in beautifully hand-crafted environments and striking character designs that bring Maiko to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RPG Forever - Seren\u2019s Quest</i> is more than a journey to save a world\u2014it\u2019s a journey to rediscover who you truly are. Will you rise as Maiko\u2019s savior, or be consumed by the echoes of a forgotten past?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RPG Forever - Seren's Quest</i>, you awaken in a world stripped of every memory. You are Seren\u2014a wanderer with no past, thrown into the mysterious land of Expressiaann, where fate whispers of a destiny tied to forces beyond your understanding. As you journey across haunting ruins and mystical landscapes, you\u2019ll meet characters whose stories intertwine with your own, each holding pieces of a forgotten puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Narrative: Experience a richly woven story where every choice shapes Seren\u2019s path\u2014and the fate of Maiko itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living World: Explore a dynamic and immersive world filled with secrets, mysteries, and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Quests and Puzzles: Take on quests that challenge your mind, and solve puzzles that unlock hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful Choices: Shape Seren\u2019s identity and relationships through decisions that ripple across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Visuals: Immerse yourself in beautifully hand-crafted environments and striking character designs that bring Maiko to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RPG Forever - Seren\u2019s Quest</i> is more than a journey to save a world\u2014it\u2019s a journey to rediscover who you truly are. Will you rise as Maiko\u2019s savior, or be consumed by the echoes of a forgotten past?</p>",
